{
"text": "[image] ENDORSER Colorado Professional Fire Fighters “John Hickenlooper understands the sacrifice firefighters make to keep Colorado safe,” said Kevin Reichenbach, President of CPFF. “CPFF is proud to endorse – and fight alongside – John Hickenlooper because he continues to fight for more bargaining rights and better access to health care for firefighters.”",
"href": "https://hickenlooper.com/hickenlooper-announces-another-round-of-major-union-endorsements/"
},
{
"text": "[image] ENDORSER Pipefitters Local 208 “Our workers deserve strong leaders like John Hickenooper. He has championed high quality apprenticeships that create pathways to good paying jobs and is fighting to strengthen unions in the Senate,” said Cecil Courtney, Business Manager for Pipefitters Local 208. “We need him in Washington to tackle corporate corruption and support union workers.”",
"href": "https://hickenlooper.com/hickenlooper-announces-another-round-of-major-union-endorsements/"
},
{
"text": "[image] ENDORSER SMART Local Union 9 “John Hickenlooper’s support for Colorado workers is in a class of its own. He’s championed legislation to support American workers. He negotiated the Bipartisan Infrastructure Law and Inflation Reduction Act, securing hundreds of millions in federal funding for Colorado that delivered good paying jobs in the process,” said Jon Alvino, Business Manager for SMART Local Union 9. “We’re proud to stand with John Hickenlooper as we fight to support working families, create family-sustaining careers, and expand apprenticeship and training opportunities.”",
"href": "https://hickenlooper.com/hickenlooper-announces-another-round-of-major-union-endorsements/"
},
